			"text": "Leader A:  shopping_cart = { milk, bread }\nLeader B:  shopping_cart = { milk, eggs  }\n\nConflict detected on shopping_cart.\n\nMerge result:  shopping_cart = { milk, bread, eggs }\n→ Union of both sets. No data lost.",
