			"index": "b06",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 919506825,
			"version": 890,
			"versionNonce": 1026431113,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1778619295580,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Leader A increments counter:  +1  (counter = 1)\nLeader B increments counter:  +1  (counter = 1)\n\nBoth sync. Naive merge would give 1. Wrong.\n\nCRDT G-Counter (Grow-only counter):\n  Each node tracks its own count separately:\n  A's state:  { A:1, B:0 }\n  B's state:  { A:0, B:1 }\n\n  Merge rule: take MAX of each node's value\n  Merged:     { A:1, B:1 }  →  total = 2  -  Correct",
			"rawText": "Leader A increments counter:  +1  (counter = 1)\nLeader B increments counter:  +1  (counter = 1)\n\nBoth sync. Naive merge would give 1. Wrong.\n\nCRDT G-Counter (Grow-only counter):\n  Each node tracks its own count separately:\n  A's state:  { A:1, B:0 }\n  B's state:  { A:0, B:1 }\n\n  Merge rule: take MAX of each node's value\n  Merged:     { A:1, B:1 }  →  total = 2  -  Correct",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "oNTHuv1RpJnewsn-cyfHr",
			"originalText": "Leader A increments counter:  +1  (counter = 1)\nLeader B increments counter:  +1  (counter = 1)\n\nBoth sync. Naive merge would give 1. Wrong.\n\nCRDT G-Counter (Grow-only counter):\n  Each node tracks its own count separately:\n  A's state:  { A:1, B:0 }\n  B's state:  { A:0, B:1 }\n\n  Merge rule: take MAX of each node's value\n  Merged:     { A:1, B:1 }  →  total = 2  -  Correct",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
