		{
			"id": "SF7QNO61",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -637.5329316157672,
			"y": 3571.2165029556245,
			"width": 1069.1993408203125,
			"height": 855,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 4,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b0KV",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1810432809,
			"version": 336,
			"versionNonce": 1243174951,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1778620550582,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Node A adds \"milk\"  →  { milk: [tag-abc] }\nNode B adds \"milk\"  →  { milk: [tag-xyz] }\n\nThese are two completely separate add events.\nEach has its own identity.\n\n\nt=1   You add milk on Phone    →  milk gets tag-abc\nt=2   You add milk on Laptop   →  milk gets tag-xyz\nt=3   You remove milk on Phone →  removes tag-abc only\n\nPhone state:   milk: [tag-abc REMOVED,  tag-xyz alive]\nLaptop state:  milk: [tag-abc alive,    tag-xyz alive]\n\nSync:\n  tag-abc = removed  (phone said so)\n  tag-xyz = alive    (nobody removed it)\n\nFinal: milk is still IN the cart  ",
			"rawText": "Node A adds \"milk\"  →  { milk: [tag-abc] }\nNode B adds \"milk\"  →  { milk: [tag-xyz] }\n\nThese are two completely separate add events.\nEach has its own identity.\n\n\nt=1   You add milk on Phone    →  milk gets tag-abc\nt=2   You add milk on Laptop   →  milk gets tag-xyz\nt=3   You remove milk on Phone →  removes tag-abc only\n\nPhone state:   milk: [tag-abc REMOVED,  tag-xyz alive]\nLaptop state:  milk: [tag-abc alive,    tag-xyz alive]\n\nSync:\n  tag-abc = removed  (phone said so)\n  tag-xyz = alive    (nobody removed it)\n\nFinal: milk is still IN the cart  ",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "y_UWp65_jxtOqamwFMZYp",
			"originalText": "Node A adds \"milk\"  →  { milk: [tag-abc] }\nNode B adds \"milk\"  →  { milk: [tag-xyz] }\n\nThese are two completely separate add events.\nEach has its own identity.\n\n\nt=1   You add milk on Phone    →  milk gets tag-abc\nt=2   You add milk on Laptop   →  milk gets tag-xyz\nt=3   You remove milk on Phone →  removes tag-abc only\n\nPhone state:   milk: [tag-abc REMOVED,  tag-xyz alive]\nLaptop state:  milk: [tag-abc alive,    tag-xyz alive]\n\nSync:\n  tag-abc = removed  (phone said so)\n  tag-xyz = alive    (nobody removed it)\n\nFinal: milk is still IN the cart  ",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
