			"updated": 1778621152697,
			"locked": false,
			"text": " \nDocument:  H(1)  e(2)  l(3)  l(4)  o(5)\n\nUser A (Delhi)  is offline  →  types \" World\" after the o\nUser B (London) is offline  →  types \" India\" after the o\n\nBoth are editing. Neither can see the other's changes yet.",
			"rawText": " \nDocument:  H(1)  e(2)  l(3)  l(4)  o(5)\n\nUser A (Delhi)  is offline  →  types \" World\" after the o\nUser B (London) is offline  →  types \" India\" after the o\n\nBoth are editing. Neither can see the other's changes yet.",
