			"updated": 1778621531398,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "A receives B's delete of id:3\nA checks: id:3 already deleted by me\nA ignores it   ← idempotent rule\n\nB receives A's delete of id:3\nB checks: id:3 already deleted by me\nB ignores it   ← idempotent rule\n\nFinal:  H(1) e(2) l(4) o(5)  =  \"Helo\"  ",
			"rawText": "A receives B's delete of id:3\nA checks: id:3 already deleted by me\nA ignores it   ← idempotent rule\n\nB receives A's delete of id:3\nB checks: id:3 already deleted by me\nB ignores it   ← idempotent rule\n\nFinal:  H(1) e(2) l(4) o(5)  =  \"Helo\"  ",
			"fontSize": 36,
