			"updated": 1778621702473,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "This is why CRDT documents grow over time.\nEvery delete is kept as a tombstone forever \n(or until a garbage collection pass runs).\n",
			"rawText": "This is why CRDT documents grow over time.\nEvery delete is kept as a tombstone forever \n(or until a garbage collection pass runs).\n",
